WEBVTT

00:00:59.006 --> 00:01:01.561
and she said, "Oh, fantastic!

00:01:01.585 --> 00:01:05.347
I want to see this! Give me a chair!
Give me a chair! I want to see it,"

00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:08.102
and she sat down in front of the machine,

00:01:08.126 --> 00:01:11.717
and she watched
the entire washing program.

00:01:11.741 --> 00:01:12.743
(Laughter)

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.192
She was mesmerized.

00:01:14.618 --> 00:01:19.046
To my grandmother,
the washing machine was a miracle.

00:01:19.966 --> 00:01:23.398
Today, in Sweden and other rich countries,

00:01:23.422 --> 00:01:27.158
people are using
so many different machines.

00:01:27.182 --> 00:01:29.167
Look -- the homes are full of machines.

00:01:29.191 --> 00:01:31.276
I can't even name them all.